Open Hermes with a model

Usage: wally hermes [OPTIONS] [args...]

Arguments:
  args                        Passed through to the tool

Options:
  -h, --help                  Show help
  -m, --model TEXT            A model on this machine, or a hosted one from your
                              account
      --hybrid                Run the main agent on a cloud model and its
                              subagents on a local model
      --cloud-model TEXT      The cloud model the main agent uses with --hybrid
                              (default: your default model)
      --policy TEXT           What --hybrid optimises for: privacy (default) or
                              cost

Examples:
  # Download the certified local model once
  wally models pull qwen3-4b-instruct-2507

  # Start the tool with the certified local model
  wally hermes -m qwen3-4b-instruct-2507

  # Use a cloud model after wally account login
  wally hermes -m glm-5.3-flash
